{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"trinket_token","model_identifier":"trinket_token","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## trinket_token\n\nTrinket, token.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -6.5..0.3, z -0.4..0.4 (size 4.0 x 6.8 x 0.8 u = 11 x 19 x 2 cm).\nToken: a flat square tag (4 x 4 u, ~11 cm, exaggerated to read) stamped with a cross mark and a punched hole, hung on a cord loop. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: copper. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_token_copper.png`, `trinket_token_tin.png`, `trinket_token_bronze.png`, `trinket_token_iron.png`, `trinket_token_steel.png`, `trinket_token_silver.png`, `trinket_token_gold.png`\n"},"description":"## trinket_token\n\nTrinket, token.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -6.5..0.3, z -0.4..0.4 (size 4.0 x 6.8 x 0.8 u = 11 x 19 x 2 cm).\nToken: a flat square tag (4 x 4 u, ~11 cm, exaggerated to read) stamped with a cross mark and a punched hole, hung on a cord loop. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: copper. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_token_copper.png`, `trinket_token_tin.png`, `trinket_token_bronze.png`, `trinket_token_iron.png`, `trinket_token_steel.png`, `trinket_token_silver.png`, `trinket_token_gold.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"eleme